; The graphics catalog: one section for each kind of graphic the game draws,
; in the order the game first shows them. Each section names the graphic, links
; to the listing entry that holds its bytes and renders it. The entry states the
; format and the colours, and the renders here repeat the entry's own.

; Masked images float on the page: a pixel that the mask lets the background
; through renders transparent.
[ImageWriter]
PNGAlpha=0

[Page:Graphics]
SectionPrefix=Graphic

[Graphic:font:Font]
The game prints its messages and the control panel's numbers in its own #R$A020(font).

#UDGTABLE { #FONT$A020,39,56,2(font) } TABLE#

#UDGTABLE { =h Glyphs | =h Characters } { #UDGARRAY10,,2($A020-$A068-8)(font_digits) | 0–9 } { #UDG$A070,,2(font_second_zero) | A second 0, which a #R$D2E6(control panel digit) rolls into after 9 } { #UDG$A078,,2(font_space) | Space } { #UDGARRAY13,,2($A080-$A0E0-8)(font_letters_1) | A–M } { #UDGARRAY13,,2($A0E8-$A148-8)(font_letters_2) | N–Z } { #UDG$A150,,2(font_slash) | [, which the font draws as a slash } TABLE#

[Graphic:control-panel:Control panel]
The #R$A158(control panel) across the top six rows of the screen, in its own colours.

