[Graphic:hatch:Hatch]
The #R$99A0(hatch bitmap) at the centre of a hatchway, and the #R$99E8(hatch patterns), two of which #R$B449(the hatchway draw) stamps into it for each screen. The render shows the hatch of screen 91.

